	(text "VBUS is the XIAO 5V pin, which Seeed wires straight to the USB connector.\nWith USB present Q1 shorts AVDD_EN to ground; R1 keeps the MCU pin from\noverriding it, so firmware cannot turn the analog rail on.\nTrip point: Q1 turns on for VBUS between 1.3 V and 2.9 V\n(Vgs(th) 0.65 to 1.45 V, AO3400A datasheet; R3/R4 halve VBUS).\nR2 holds the rail off while the MCU pin floats (reset, bootloader).\nU2 needs EN above 1.2 V to run: 3.3 V x 100k/110k = 3.0 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 140 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "dadb2ea3-a557-59c6-a8f0-e0fe50d3ca79")
	)
