	(text "Suggested motor: Leader LCM1027B3605F (LCSC C7528806), a 10 mm coin motor on wire leads.\nIts datasheet gives 3.0 V rated, 2.7 to 3.3 V operating, 70 mA running, 120 mA starting.\nR5 drops the battery (up to 4.2 V) into that range: 4.2 V x 43/(43+12) = 3.3 V,\ntaking the running motor as 3.0 V / 70 mA = 43 ohm. Recalculate R5 for any other motor.\nD1 is the flyback diode, R6 the gate pull-down."
